WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.469 --> 00:00:12.169
Hey youtubers it’s charlie, I hope you had
an awesome thanksgiving.

00:00:12.169 --> 00:00:20.180
Since we’ve already gotten some really good
info on Legend Of Korra Book 3 and Michael

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:22.810
Dante DiMartino and Bryan Koneyetzko have
kind of given their own post-morten thoughts

00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:24.340
on Book 2 I thought I’d do a video explaining
the Top 5 things about book 2 that will change

00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:26.019
in book 3 along with an overall review of
the episodes.

00:00:26.019 --> 00:00:29.050
So quick update on where everything is in
terms of production right now.

00:00:29.050 --> 00:00:33.010
As of New York Comic Con this year Book 3
was in the middle of being animated and the

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:34.420
writing on book 4 was finished.

00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:37.809
The episodes for both books have already been
ordered from Nickelodeon.

00:00:37.809 --> 00:00:39.542
So regardless of future ratings, we’ll see
both books.

00:00:39.542 --> 00:00:45.280
Book 3 in 2014 and Book 4 in 2014.

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:47.339
I’ll talk more about release dates in a
future video.

00:00:47.339 --> 00:00:49.800
Currently they haven’t made any announcement
on when book 3 will premiere.

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:51.769
So let’s dive in to Book 3 changes.

00:00:51.769 --> 00:00:54.330
Here’s the top 5 biggest changes coming.

00:00:54.330 --> 00:00:57.339
Number 5 - No more teenage Romance.

00:00:57.339 --> 00:01:01.760
Dimartino said that because fans got so upset
every time they tried to do a teenage romance

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:11.810
subplots, none of the story in book 3 would
focus on that.

00:01:11.810 --> 00:01:15.200
At the end of book 2 Korra and Mako are finished
and Book 3 picks up a couple weeks after the

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:18.960
end of book 2, so the wounds from their breakup
will still be pretty fresh, but if it is referenced

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:19.960
it will only be very briefly.

00:01:19.960 --> 00:01:21.310
So if you hated all the Makorra Masami stuff
you are in luck.

00:01:21.310 --> 00:01:22.610
Number 4 - Earth Kingdom.

00:01:22.610 --> 00:01:23.610
So remember the avatar cycle.

00:01:23.610 --> 00:01:27.540
It was a big part of Avatar Wan learning all
the bending styles and it directly influences

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:29.860
which tribe each new avatar is born in.

00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:34.243
So far we started with Air, the water in book
2, so you can expect a lot of the story in

00:01:34.243 --> 00:01:36.690
book 3 to deal with the earth kingdom and
ultimately back to fire for book 4.

00:01:36.690 --> 00:01:39.790
Number 3 - Lots more Bumi and Lin Beifong.

00:01:39.790 --> 00:01:43.020
Bumi isn’t a bender, but DiMartino and Konyetzko
already confirmed that there will be tons

00:01:43.020 --> 00:01:44.450
more Bumi.

00:01:44.450 --> 00:01:51.479
But book 2 really didn’t include a lot of
Biefong and we still have no idea who her

00:01:51.479 --> 00:01:52.479
father is.

00:01:52.479 --> 00:01:57.140
There’s no guarantee that Book 3 will reveal
that secret, but because it’s an earth book

00:01:57.140 --> 00:02:00.380
she will be a much more central to the story
outside of team avatar.

00:02:00.380 --> 00:02:03.729
Number 2 - Korra will still be spiritually
cut off from the previous avatars.

00:02:03.729 --> 00:02:08.920
And the changes to the world at the end of
book 2 will stick.

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:12.870
Meaning the spirits will be freely inhabiting
the physical realm.

00:02:12.870 --> 00:02:20.459
The interesting thing about this is that spirits
genuinely are immortal, so Korra can still

00:02:20.459 --> 00:02:23.080
get the wisdom of ancient spirits, just not
the previous avatars.

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:25.459
So Iroh can still give her guidance.

00:02:25.459 --> 00:02:33.870
But I don’t think he’s going to be re-joining
team avatar every single week.

00:02:33.870 --> 00:02:43.400
If you’re still confused about the whole
thing, Korra can still learn things about

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:44.400
the past avatars.

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:45.780
She’ll just be experiencing them through
other people’s memories.

00:02:45.780 --> 00:02:46.780
Like when your friend tells you about something
your other friend did.

00:02:46.780 --> 00:02:48.450
She just won’t automatically be able to
recall things in her memory unless she learned

00:02:48.450 --> 00:02:49.450
them before raava was destroyed.

00:02:49.450 --> 00:02:57.340
and number 1 - The central conflict will not
revolve around Korra’s bending abilities.

00:02:57.340 --> 00:03:00.770
At the end of book 2 Korra learns to energy
bend.

00:03:00.770 --> 00:03:05.280
That’s not going to change in book 2.

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:17.000
So her ability to defeat the villains won’t
depend on her bending prowess.

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:27.099
Book 3 will be a much more existential story.

00:03:27.099 --> 00:03:30.460
If you saw thor the dark world, loki tells
thor.

00:03:30.460 --> 00:03:32.349
You can’t solve all your problems with hitting.

00:03:32.349 --> 00:03:34.540
It will be the same situation in book 3.

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:38.099
This is just the next step to Korra becoming
a fully actualized avatar.

00:03:38.099 --> 00:03:44.080
Wouldn’t it be crazy though if Korra became
the perfect avatar by the end of book 3 and

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:45.310
then in Book 4 another 100 year war started?

00:03:45.310 --> 00:03:48.140
I don’t think that’s going to happen but
it does make you wonder…

00:03:48.140 --> 00:03:53.709
As a side note too, both DiMartino and Konyetzko
said that after book 4 there would be no more

00:03:53.709 --> 00:03:56.780
new avatar shows.

00:03:56.780 --> 00:04:03.110
They’re so fried from working constantly
for the last several years that they’re

00:04:03.110 --> 00:04:06.690
going to take a long break from the world
of avatar.

00:04:06.690 --> 00:04:13.280
Book 4 is still at least 15-18 months away,
so a lot can still change to make them reconsider

00:04:13.280 --> 00:04:14.280
though.

00:04:14.280 --> 00:04:18.519
But Book 4 will be designed as a series finale,
not just a season finale.

00:04:18.519 --> 00:04:26.490
With regards to some of the bigger changes
they’re making I actually think that they’re

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:28.090
all really positive.

00:04:28.090 --> 00:04:34.120
It makes sense that they wouldn’t just keep
bringing back the same types of challenges.

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:40.020
Korra mastered the physical realm, so the
only way to keep the story fresh is to do

00:04:40.020 --> 00:04:41.770
a much more existential journey.

00:04:41.770 --> 00:04:45.970
Korra basically has to learn what it means
to be the avatar without the benefit of all

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:48.930
the other avatars and she has to help the
world learn how to live with spirits.

00:04:48.930 --> 00:04:52.560
But now that we know all these things let
me know what you’re most excited to see

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:57.120
in book 3, who are you hoping they bring back
from last airbender and what are your final

00:04:57.120 --> 00:04:58.120
thoughts on book 2?

00:04:58.120 --> 00:05:00.970
I’ll be doing some fun Korra videos in the
next couple of weeks.

00:05:00.970 --> 00:05:02.510
be sure to subscribe to get them.

00:05:02.510 --> 00:05:07.540
There won’t be any more mega book 3 announcements
for the rest of the year, so I’ll just be

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:08.720
doing fun bonus videos.

00:05:08.720 --> 00:05:13.050
I’m also still figuring out which new anime
series to do videos for.

00:05:13.050 --> 00:05:17.070
One of the biggest suggestions has been fairy
tale, and I’m already doing attack on titan

00:05:17.070 --> 00:05:18.070
as soon as it comes back.

00:05:18.070 --> 00:05:19.700
But I’ll try to keep you posted on what
I decide.

